          <li><strong>Active Outdoor Walks:</strong> Backyard safaris and park hikes where your child spots a strange beetle or hears a bird call and asks, <em>"What is that?"</em></li>
        </ol>
        <p>
          To give your family a complete nature toolkit, we selected the best apps across both categories—all <strong>100% ad-free</strong> and respectful of children's attention.
