        <h2>The 7 Best Nature &amp; Animal Apps for Children</h2>

        <!-- 1. KIDAMAME DISCOVERY -->
        <div class="app-review-card kidamame-pick">
          <div class="app-review-header">
            <div>
              <span class="app-pick-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-earth-americas"></i> Best Calm Biome &amp; Wildlife Explorer (Ages 4–10)</span>
              <h3 style="margin-top: 0.6rem !important;">1. Kidamame Discovery</h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="app-specs-bar">
            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-child"></i> Ages 4–10</span>
            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-infinity"></i> One-Time Purchase (No Subscription)</span>
            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-paw"></i> 120+ Interactive Elements &amp; ~400 Facts</span>
            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-plane-departure"></i> 100% Offline</span>
          </div>
          <p>
            <strong><a href="/discovery/">Kidamame Discovery</a></strong> is a calm, Montessori-inspired digital picture book where the natural world comes alive at your child's fingertips. Designed for kids ages 4–10 and their families, it replaces noisy timers and points with pure, child-led exploration across <strong>6 rich ecosystems</strong>:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The Alps, African Savannah, Australian Outback, The Arctic, Sonoran Desert, and Amazon Rainforest:</strong> Each scene contains <strong>20 or more interactive animals, plants, and natural phenomena</strong> (120+ in total).</li>
            <li><strong>Authentic Sounds &amp; Gentle Animations:</strong> Tap the ostrich to see its eggs tumble, touch the volcano to watch an eruption, or watch a glacier calve into the sea while listening to authentic wildlife calls and ambient forest sounds.</li>
            <li><strong>Around 400 "Did You Know?" Cards:</strong> Tapping the magnifying glass reveals illustrated science facts in 6 languages (English, Italian, French, German, Spanish, and Portuguese) that are genuinely fascinating for both children and parents.</li>
            <li><strong>100% Offline, No Ads, No Subscriptions:</strong> Try it for free and unlock the full app forever with a single one-time purchase.</li>
          </ul>
