            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-child"></i> Ages 5–12+ (with Parent)</span>
            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-tag"></i> 100% Free</span>
            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Zero Data Collection / No Login</span>
