          <p>
            Created by a joint initiative of the California Academy of Sciences and the National Geographic Society, <a href="https://www.inaturalist.org/pages/seek_app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Seek by iNaturalist</a> is the kid-safe version of the research platform iNaturalist. Point your device's camera at any wildflower, tree leaf, mushroom, or beetle on a family walk, and Seek identifies the species in real time using on-device computer vision.
          </p>
        </div>

